## Backend Worker CORS post-deploy check（MANDATORY）

> 觸發：`wrangler deploy` 完成後、宣布 deploy 成功前。

### 為什麼這條規則存在

2026-09-07 production 登入 CORS drop：Worker runtime 直接 emit 503（沒進 Hono chain），curl 看起來是「backend 503」但瀏覽器 silent CORS drop。3 層 CORS defense 任何一層失效都會觸發 — 而 curl 沒辦法在 HTTPS origin 內觸發 CORS policy，所以純 curl 檢查抓不到。

詳見 `.cursor/rules/036-worker-runtime-cors-defense.mdc` + `runs/improvements/feedback/20260907-cors-runtime-503-fix.md`。

### Backend Worker deploy 後必跑 curl 矩陣

每次 `wrangler deploy` 完成 backend Worker 後，**必跑**這條 curl 矩陣，缺一即視為 deploy 失敗：

```bash
BACKEND="https://saome-backend.josh1989213.workers.dev"
ORIGIN="https://saome-frontend.josh1989213.workers.dev"

# 1. OPTIONS preflight — 必回 204 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin
echo "=== OPTIONS preflight ==="
curl -sS -i -X OPTIONS "$BACKEND/api/auth/login" \
    -H "Origin: $ORIGIN" \
    -H "Access-Control-Request-Method: POST" \
    -H "Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type" \
    2>&1 | head -20

# 預期：HTTP/1.1 204 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin: $ORIGIN + Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true

# 2. POST 帶 Origin（即使錯誤憑證）— 必回 Access-Control-Allow-Origin
echo ""
echo "=== POST with Origin (wrong creds) ==="
curl -sS -i -X POST "$BACKEND/api/auth/login" \
    -H "Origin: $ORIGIN" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"email":"nonexistent@test.invalid","password":"wrong"}' \
    2>&1 | head -20

# 預期：HTTP/1.1 401 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin: $ORIGIN
# （不是 503 + 沒 CORS — 那是 runtime-emitted bug）

# 3. POST 帶 evil origin — 必 NOT 回 Access-Control-Allow-Origin
echo ""
echo "=== POST with evil origin (regression for security boundary) ==="
curl -sS -i -X POST "$BACKEND/api/auth/login" \
    -H "Origin: https://evil.example.com" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"email":"x@x.x","password":"x"}' \
    2>&1 | head -20

# 預期：HTTP/1.1 4xx + 沒有 Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
```

### 什麼情況算 deploy 失敗

| 檢查項 | 預期 | 失敗 = |
|---|---|---|
| OPTIONS 回 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` | $ORIGIN | Layer 1（corsMiddleware）失效 — 不能 ship |
| POST 401/200 回 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` | $ORIGIN | Layer 3（runtimeCors）失效 — 不能 ship |
| POST 503 回 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` | $ORIGIN | Worker runtime 路徑 CORS 漏 — 不能 ship（本次事故）|
| evil origin POST 不回 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` | null | CORS 過於寬鬆 — 立即修 |

### 為什麼 curl 沒第一時間抓到 production 503

```bash
# 修前
curl -X POST .../api/auth/login -H "Origin: ..."
# → 503，沒 CORS header
# 看起來像「backend 503」(合理錯誤)

# 但 wrangler tail 證實這條 request 沒進 Hono
# → runtime 直接 emit → 瀏覽器 silent drop
# → curl 解讀為「backend 503」，瀏覽器解讀為「CORS 拒絕」
```

curl 跟瀏覽器的解讀完全分裂 — 這是 SAOME 自 2026-07-28 Bug-4c 起的 fingerprint。

### 寫成 post-deploy script（建議）

在 `apps/backend/package.json` 的 `deploy` script 後串接：

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "deploy": "wrangler deploy && node scripts/check-cors-post-deploy.cjs"
  }
}
```

`scripts/check-cors-post-deploy.cjs` 範本：

```js
// Run after `wrangler deploy` succeeds — fail loudly if backend Worker
// doesn't return CORS headers for the production origin.
const BACKEND = 'https://saome-backend.josh1989213.workers.dev';
const ORIGIN = 'https://saome-frontend.josh1989213.workers.dev';

async function check(label, fn) {
  const { status, headers } = await fn();
  const acao = headers.get('access-control-allow-origin');
  console.log(`[${label}] status=${status} ACAO=${acao}`);
  return acao === ORIGIN;
}

(async () => {
  let pass = true;
  pass &= await check('OPTIONS', () =>
    fetch(BACKEND + '/api/auth/login', {
      method: 'OPTIONS',
      headers: {
        Origin: ORIGIN,
        'Access-Control-Request-Method': 'POST',
        'Access-Control-Request-Headers': 'Content-Type',
      },
    }),
  );
  pass &= await check('POST (wrong creds)', () =>
    fetch(BACKEND + '/api/auth/login', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { Origin: ORIGIN, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ email: 'x@x.x', password: 'x' }),
    }),
  );
  if (!pass) {
    console.error('FAIL: backend Worker CORS post-deploy check failed');
    process.exit(1);
  }
  console.log('OK: backend Worker CORS post-deploy check passed');
})();
```

